  "description": "A lich stands atop a skull-carved ziggurat sinking into a misty swamp, while a paladin, dwarf cleric, ranger and sorceress advance along a broken causeway past wading skeletons, toppled priest statues and two dead trees. 510 x 440 mm base of 4 clip-jointed A1 tiles with a printed water surface; ziggurat, causeway, trees, obelisk and pillars on FDM, 5 figures, 5 skeletons, statues, braziers and 54 reeds on resin (95 prints). Built with the scene workflow using Tripo meshes (460 credits) and Claude assembly. Not yet test printed.",
